{
 "lessonId": "lesson-20-events",
 "allow": [
  "html",
  "css",
  "js"
 ],
 "topic": {
  "ru": "События и делегирование",
  "uz": "Hodisalar va delegatsiya",
  "en": "Events and delegation"
 },
 "sections": {
  "2": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "preventDefault",
    "uz": "preventDefault",
    "en": "preventDefault"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Форма без перезагрузки страницы.",
    "uz": "Sahifa qayta yuklanmaydigan forma.",
    "en": "A form without a page reload."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <form class=\"form\">\n    <input placeholder=\"Имя\">\n    <button>Отправить</button>\n  </form>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": "",
    "script.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "addEventListener\\(\\s*[\"\\']submit[\"\\']\\s*,\\s*(function\\s*\\(\\s*e\\s*\\)|\\(?\\s*e\\s*\\)?\\s*=>)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Слушай `\"submit\"` у формы и прими `e`",
      "uz": "Formada `\"submit\"` ni tingla va `e` ni ol",
      "en": "Listen for `\"submit\"` on the form and take `e`"
     },
     "show": "const form = document.querySelector(\".form\");\nform.addEventListener(\"submit\", function (e) {\n\n});"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "e\\.preventDefault\\(\\s*\\)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Отмени перезагрузку: `e.preventDefault();`",
      "uz": "Qayta yuklanishni bekor qil: `e.preventDefault();`",
      "en": "Cancel the reload: `e.preventDefault();`"
     },
     "show": "e.preventDefault();"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  },
  "3": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "Список задач",
    "uz": "Vazifalar ro'yxati",
    "en": "A to-do list"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "По клику добавим задачу в список.",
    "uz": "Bosilganda ro'yxatga vazifa qo'shamiz.",
    "en": "On click we'll add a task to the list."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <input class=\"task\" placeholder=\"Задача\">\n  <button id=\"add\">Добавить</button>\n  <ul class=\"list\"></ul>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": "",
    "script.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "document\\.createElement\\(\\s*[\"\\']li[\"\\']\\s*\\)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Создай пункт: `const li = document.createElement(\"li\");`",
      "uz": "Band yarat: `const li = document.createElement(\"li\");`",
      "en": "Create an item: `const li = document.createElement(\"li\");`"
     },
     "show": "const li = document.createElement(\"li\");"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "li\\.textContent\\s*=\\s*\\w+\\.value",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Текст из поля: `li.textContent = input.value;`",
      "uz": "Maydondagi matn: `li.textContent = input.value;`",
      "en": "Text from the field: `li.textContent = input.value;`"
     },
     "show": "li.textContent = input.value;"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "\\.(append|appendChild)\\(\\s*li\\s*\\)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Добавь в список: `list.append(li);`",
      "uz": "Ro'yxatga qo'sh: `list.append(li);`",
      "en": "Add it to the list: `list.append(li);`"
     },
     "show": "list.append(li);"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "\\.value\\s*=\\s*[\"\\']{2}",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Очисти поле: `input.value = \"\";`",
      "uz": "Maydonni tozala: `input.value = \"\";`",
      "en": "Clear the field: `input.value = \"\";`"
     },
     "show": "input.value = \"\";"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  }
 },
 "homework": {
  "title": {
   "ru": "Удаление по клику",
   "uz": "Bosganda o'chirish",
   "en": "Delete on click"
  },
  "intro": {
   "ru": "По клику на пункт он удаляется. Один обработчик на весь список — делегирование.",
   "uz": "Bandga bosilganda u o'chadi. Butun ro'yxatga bitta ishlovchi — delegatsiya.",
   "en": "Clicking an item removes it. One handler for the whole list — delegation."
  },
  "files": {
   "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <input class=\"task\" placeholder=\"Задача\">\n  <button id=\"add\">Добавить</button>\n  <ul class=\"list\">\n    <li>Купить хлеб</li>\n    <li>Сделать домашку</li>\n  </ul>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
   "style.css": "",
   "script.js": ""
  },
  "steps": [
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "(list|ul)\\w*\\.addEventListener\\(\\s*[\"\\']click[\"\\']",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Обработчик клика — на сам список `.list`",
     "uz": "Bosish ishlovchisi — `.list` ro'yxatning o'zida",
     "en": "The click handler goes on the `.list` itself"
    },
    "show": "const list = document.querySelector(\".list\");\nlist.addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n\n});"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "e\\.target\\.tagName\\s*===?\\s*[\"\\']LI[\"\\']",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Проверь, что нажали пункт: `if (e.target.tagName === \"LI\")`",
     "uz": "Band bosilganini tekshir: `if (e.target.tagName === \"LI\")`",
     "en": "Check that an item was clicked: `if (e.target.tagName === \"LI\")`"
    },
    "show": "if (e.target.tagName === \"LI\") {\n  e.target.remove();\n}"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "e\\.target\\.remove\\(\\s*\\)",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Удали: `e.target.remove();`",
     "uz": "O'chir: `e.target.remove();`",
     "en": "Remove it: `e.target.remove();`"
    },
    "show": "e.target.remove();"
   }
  ],
  "open": "script.js"
 }
}
